### ==============================================================================
### EVENTS MANAGEMENT APIS
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. List All Events (Upcoming / Past)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?upcoming=true

### 2. Create Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "State Youth Leadership Summit 2026",
  "titleHi": "राज्य युवा नेतृत्व महासम्मेलन 2026",
  "description": "Annual convention of delegates, social activists, and youth coordinators.",
  "descriptionHi": "सामाजिक कार्यकर्ताओं एवं युवा समन्वयकों का वार्षिक महाधिवेशन।",
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "time": "10:00 AM - 04:00 PM",
  "location": "Krishna Vihar Pala Road Aligarh, Uttar Pradesh",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511578314322-379afb476865?w=600",
  "isUpcoming": true
}

### 3. Delete Event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/EVENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
